      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The town sits at the gateway of the Sauk River Chain of Lakes, a connected system of 14 bay‑like lakes fed by the Sauk River.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cold_Spring%2C_Minnesota",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "During the grasshopper plagues of the 1870s, residents built Assumption Chapel—also called the Grasshopper Chapel—to seek relief from the locusts.",
